# Universal Agent Rules — Quy tắc cho Devin.ai, OpenCode, Oh-My-Pi, Oh-My-OpenAgent, và mọi AI Agent

## MANDATORY FIRST STEP — Phải làm trước tiên
Before doing ANYTHING, read the workspace session register:
**`plans/ACTIVE_SESSION_REGISTER.md`**
This file tells you: current project status, what was just done, and exactly what to do next.

## Pre-Action Interception Hooks (DO NOT WAIT FOR GIT/SCRIPT ERRORS)
- **Pre-Write Path Check**: Verify destination path BEFORE creating files. Never create rogue files at root or outside approved directories.
- **In-Flight Co-Update**: When modifying code in `crates/`, update matching `docs/` (both `.md` and `.vi.md`) and `docs/sitemap_and_component_registry.md` in the SAME turn.
- **Real-Time Register**: Update `plans/ACTIVE_SESSION_REGISTER.md` before concluding any session.

## The 6 Golden Laws (Never Break)
1. **NEVER** create files or folders outside the defined workspace structure. Put temp files in `scratch/` only.
2. **ALWAYS** update `docs/` when modifying `crates/`. Run `./scripts/verify_docs_sync.sh` to confirm.
3. **ALWAYS** run `cargo check --workspace` after any Rust code change. Fix errors before proceeding.
4. **NEVER** import code from `research/` into `crates/`. They are strictly isolated.
5. **ALWAYS** use `./scripts/git_sync.sh "conventional commit message"` to commit — never raw `git commit`.
6. **ALWAYS** update `plans/ACTIVE_SESSION_REGISTER.md` at the end of every session.


## Workspace Structure (Memorize This)
- `crates/` → Rust production code ONLY (eco-core, eco-radar, eco-mcp, eco-agents, eco-cli)
- `docs/` → Living documentation (must stay in sync with code)
- `research/` → Standalone research scripts and data (ISOLATED)
- `rules/` → AI behavioral laws (read-only, do not modify without explicit instruction)
- `plans/` → Task tracking and session registers
- `brainstorm/` → Strategy and red-team analysis (read-only)
- `grants/` → Anthropic grant application (modify only when explicitly instructed)
- `scripts/` → Automation tools
- `scratch/` → Throwaway scratchpads (gitignored)

## Technology Stack
- **Primary Language**: Rust (Edition 2021)
- **Async Runtime**: Tokio
- **CLI Framework**: Clap v4
- **JSON Serialization**: Serde + serde_json
- **Protocol**: FastMCP 2.0 / rmcp (JSON-RPC 2.0)
- **AI**: Anthropic Claude 3.7 Sonnet with Extended Thinking
- **Memory Safety**: `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]` on ALL crates
- **License**: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0

## Build & Test Commands
```bash
cargo check --workspace                          # Verify code compiles
cargo test --workspace                           # Run all tests
cargo build --release                            # Build optimized binary
./scripts/verify_docs_sync.sh                    # Check documentation sync
./scripts/git_sync.sh "your commit message"      # Commit and push
cargo run -p eco-cli -- scan --category c-ffi    # Demo scan command
```
